- **1 `credits_ai` per successful `/api/ai` call** (Sonnet `complex` and Haiku `bulk`) via `authorizeAiRequest` / `recordAiSuccess` in [`server.js`](server.js). Deduct only after Anthropic 200. Mirror TTS. Trial stays on the weekly `ai_usage` cap, not the paid pool. Team spends the workspace pool first. Admin bypass like TTS. Image gen stays unmetered.
- **Do not** meter as 1 credit per Generate click or as complex-only (hydrate would be free).
- QC regen must send the Bearer token ([`qcService.ts`](src/services/qcService.ts) + [`getSupabaseAccessToken`](src/lib/supabaseAccessToken.ts)).
